ntends installed into\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/frontends.cljc:85:   host supplies its own `:frontends`.\"\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/frontends.cljc:90:         (update :frontends #(or % (standard)))\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/embed.cljc:9:  (:require [yin.repl.frontends :as repl.frontends]\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/embed.cljc:31:                 :repl (repl.frontends/create-state {:primitives primitives})}))\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/driver.cljc:22:            [yin.repl.frontends :as repl.frontends]\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/driver.cljc:80:     {:repl (or repl (repl.frontends/create-state))\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl.cljc:888:   `:frontends` is the frontend catalog (`yang.frontend`) the session\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl.cljc:890:   requires no frontend; see `yin.repl.frontends`).  Without it the catalog\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl.cljc:901:            frontends admission]\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl.cljc:945:        :frontends (or frontends frontend/empty-catalog)\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl.cljc:1703:  (let [selected (select-frontend (:frontends state) lang)]\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl.cljc:1860:             (if (usable-binding (select-frontend (:frontends state) lang))\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl.cljc:2075:  (:probe (usable-binding (select-frontend (:frontends state) (:lang state)))))\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/serve.cljc:41:            [yin.repl.frontends :as repl.frontends]\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/serve.cljc:224:              :repl (or repl (repl.frontends/create-state))\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/main.cljc:23:            [yin.repl.frontends :as repl.frontends]\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/main.cljc:624:             :repl (repl.frontends/create-state\n20:slices 3 and 4 (tracing, threads), C4 (section 8.5.6 records the design\n263:  implementations, configuration, allocation counters, and caches belong\n270:- **No shared mutable state:** compiler state is immutable and threaded\n533:### 4.2 Grammar discipline and per-host generation\n570:### 4.3 What remains host-local\n577:- ANTLR contexts, tokens, ATN/DFA structures, and prediction caches.\n581:Generated recognizers may use shared caches. Th